#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:5
#: b7c6c4cf8c3045a9a62cfd7640a9dec2
msgid "Bluetooth Telemetry radio"
msgstr "蓝牙数传电台"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:6
#: d5aa58084db64461a7d31ff36cd3bf0d
msgid ""
"` A Bluetooth Data Link , such as an `HC-06 module "
"<https://www.amazon.com/s?k=hc-06>`__ can be used to connect your Pixhawk "
"(or other controller) to your Bluetooth enabled PC or Android Ground station"
" at distances up to 50m."
msgstr ""
"蓝牙数据链路（例如 `HC-06 模块 <https://www.amazon.com/s?k=hc-06>`__）可用于将您的 "
"Pixhawk（或其他飞控）连接到支持蓝牙的 PC 或 Android 地面站，距离最远可达 50m。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:16
#: 14b70418175346feb6915ecb68e8ee9a
msgid "Connecting to the Autopilot"
msgstr "连接到飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:18
#: 701f73c63017486da702ecf8915fc3a1
msgid ""
"The Bluetooth data link comes with both a DF13 6 pin and 6-to-5 pin "
"connector which make it easy to connect to the Pixhawk Telem1 or APM2.x's "
"Telem ports.  Note that for the Pixhawk, although Telem1 is the "
"recommendation, Telem2 or even Serial 4/5 will work."
msgstr ""
"蓝牙数据链路配有 DF13 6 针和 6 转 5 针连接器，便于连接到 Pixhawk Telem1 或 APM2.x 的 Telem "
"端口。请注意，对于 Pixhawk，虽然推荐使用 Telem1，但 Telem2 甚至 Serial 4/5 也可以使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:26
#: edc91c4d47d54e9dbbe9fb52937beff1
msgid ""
"Once you have connected the Bluetooth data link you can power up the board."
"  It is OK to use USB connected power while using the Bluetooth module "
"connected to the autopilot as the USB connection can supply enough power BUT"
" YOU MUST USE A WALL WART with Micro or Mini USB)."
msgstr ""
"连接蓝牙数据链路后即可为板子上电。使用蓝牙模块连接飞控时，也可以使用 USB 供电，因为 USB 连接可以提供足够的电力，但必须使用带 Micro 或 "
"Mini USB 的电源适配器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:31
#: 2202b5e57b284445a7097a925131bf85
msgid "Bluetooth data link's LEDs:"
msgstr "蓝牙数据链路的 LED 指示："

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:33
#: 46619de24ae648089a6f11ec99f3ebc5
msgid "Red LED blinks at 1hz : device is working, not connected"
msgstr "红色 LED 以 1Hz 闪烁：设备正常工作，未连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:34
#: 09115a9541f049fdace4f200439de781
msgid "Red LED blinks at 0.5z : pairing"
msgstr "红色 LED 以 0.5Hz 闪烁：配对中"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:35
#: a56de8730f664727ab426c24b06deb21
msgid "Red LED solid : connected"
msgstr "红色 LED 常亮：已连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:38
#: 05b42888e4404cb4a06f93f1b6a845d7
msgid "Quick Start connecting with Mission Planner"
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner 快速连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:40
#: 85f265c285ca430499fb737b7cc5b81b
msgid ""
"If you are familiar with Bluetooth, search for Bluetooth Device HC-05 or 6 "
"(some may have Linvor as well) , Pair with device (code 1234 or 0000) check "
"it's properties and look at the services tab. Make sure SPP com port box is "
"checked (only there if your Bluetooth device is active) Look in Device "
"Manager (Windows) and make sure there is a Com Port for the Bluetooth and in"
" the com port properties set the baud rate to 57600 (note the Com Port "
"number)."
msgstr ""
"如果您熟悉蓝牙，请搜索蓝牙设备 HC-05 或 HC-06（部分设备也可能显示为 Linvor），与设备配对（代码 1234 或 "
"0000），查看其属性并查看服务选项卡。确保 SPP COM "
"端口复选框已勾选（仅当蓝牙设备处于活动状态时才会显示）。在设备管理器（Windows）中查看，确保蓝牙有对应的 COM 端口，并在 COM "
"端口属性中将波特率设置为 57600（记下 COM 端口号）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:50
#: 344790ed478f44ad9f8eb045d97f714b
msgid ""
"For use with Mission Planner on the Configure/Tuning tab make sure and "
"UNCHECK the box **Reset on USB Connect**:"
msgstr "在 Mission Planner 的配置/调参选项卡中使用时，请确保取消勾选 **USB 连接时重置** 复选框："

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:56
#: b7344295ac0c43e3862e2600b1596e4b
msgid ""
"The default Baud Rate for the Bluetooth Module is 57600 (most other modules "
"are 9600) Be sure when you connect it is at 57600 and for the new Com Port "
"you saw in Device Manager."
msgstr ""
"蓝牙模块的默认波特率为 57600（大多数其他模块为 9600）。连接时请确保使用 57600 波特率，并选择您在设备管理器中看到的新 COM 端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:60
#: 16e9127c29a4468f947efda8dad42f4e
msgid ""
"When you power up the PixHawk or APM with the Bluetooth the module will "
"flash at 1hz the red LED when not connected. When Paring it will flash at .5"
" Hz and when connected it will be steady on."
msgstr "当您用蓝牙模块为 Pixhawk 或 APM 上电时，未连接时红色 LED 以 1Hz 闪烁，配对时以 0.5Hz 闪烁，连接后常亮。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:64
#: 576e249243a446f5a43c6f6ac10037af
msgid ""
"And you're done! You can now use your Bluetooth telemetry for up to about "
"50m range. (your range may vary depending on back ground noise and "
"conditions in your area)"
msgstr "完成！您现在可以使用蓝牙数传，通信距离约 50m（实际距离因背景噪声和您所在区域的环境条件而异）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:68
#: 35027d73e1874dbc9c8b3c0659fb7978
msgid ""
"If you have problems connecting or you don't know Bluetooth very well or you"
" want to change the default Baud Rate or Device Name, read on for the step "
"by step process."
msgstr "如果您连接有问题，或对蓝牙不熟悉，或想更改默认波特率或设备名称，请继续阅读逐步操作流程。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:75
#: 55b16f1cc38b470eaab10618d7705c1f
msgid "Detailed connecting with Mission Planner"
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner 详细连接步骤"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:80
#: 841c2d5ddaea46b88e84c52346c5d618
msgid ""
"Many PCs and Laptops have bluetooth adapters built in but if not then you "
"can use a generic USB Bluetooth dongle (pic above) or use an additional "
"Bluetooth data link connected via an `FTDI Cable "
"<https://www.amazon.com/ftdi-adapter/s?k=ftdi+adapter>`__."
msgstr ""
"许多 PC 和笔记本电脑内置了蓝牙适配器，如果没有，可以使用通用 USB 蓝牙加密狗（如上图）或通过 `FTDI 电缆 "
"<https://www.amazon.com/ftdi-adapter/s?k=ftdi+adapter>`__ 连接额外的蓝牙数据链路。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:85
#: f82b9ef1f5074b70ae3b78d60466b953
msgid ""
"After first making sure your autopilot is powered on, and your PC's "
"bluetooth dongle is plugged in and installed, click on the Windows task "
"bar's little up triangle (aka \"show hidden icons\") which should be on the "
"bottom right of the screen."
msgstr "首先确保飞控已上电，PC 蓝牙加密狗已插入并安装好，然后点击 Windows 任务栏右下角的小三角形（即「显示隐藏图标」）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:93
#: d6277c985db348999667bdfbee508665
msgid ""
"The \"hidden icons box\" should appear. Right-mouse-button-click on the "
"BlueTooth icon and select \"show Bluetooth devices\""
msgstr "「隐藏图标框」应该会出现。右键单击蓝牙图标并选择「显示蓝牙设备」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:102
#: 1d788d47ad1249d2b86f2b066723d251
msgid ""
"Windows should bring up the devices box. Any devices you may already have "
"connected by Bluetooth will be in this box. If you have not connected any BT"
" devices before this box will be empty. Select \"Add a device\"."
msgstr "Windows 将弹出设备框。您已通过蓝牙连接的设备将显示在此框中。如果您之前未连接过任何 BT 设备，此框将为空。选择「添加设备」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:110
#: 6ab2387d112c4ef5af04553b0db666f6
msgid ""
"Windows will search for BT devices for you. If you have any BT devices "
"turned on they will show up here (like perhaps your cell phone) ignore any "
"other devices and select the HC-05 or HC-06 (or Linvor) ."
msgstr ""
"Windows 将为您搜索 BT 设备。如果有任何 BT 设备已开启，它们将显示在此处（例如您的手机），忽略其他设备，选择 HC-05 或 "
"HC-06（或 Linvor）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:117
#: 70d3197efbbc4a1e95b0236c806a6b46
msgid "Select Paring using device code."
msgstr "选择使用设备代码配对。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:122
#: eb19b09701c044669eee659fd021c346
msgid "Enter the device code (1234 or 0000) this is the default code."
msgstr "输入设备代码（1234 或 0000），这是默认代码。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:127
#: 1280bfa65a8f4adba66523787350541c
msgid ""
"Once paired right click the device and select \"properties\" The check box "
"for Comm Port SPP should be checked (also note the com port number)."
msgstr "配对后右键单击设备并选择「属性」，Comm 端口 SPP 的复选框应已勾选（同时记下 COM 端口号）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:133
#: 22054f5bc6014ef981a5f9c1879db3cb
msgid "In device manager select Com Ports"
msgstr "在设备管理器中选择 COM 端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:135
#: 0d7ba35fa10245e0b7c46c48d4a7523f
msgid "Choose the comm port you noted in the above step."
msgstr "选择您在上述步骤中记下的 COM 端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:137
#: 225f8d8810bd47109b29487edf3cda2d
msgid "Right click and select \"properties\""
msgstr "右键单击并选择「属性」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:139
#: f095bf33b11b440da9889fb44306bbf5
msgid "Change baud rate to 57600"
msgstr "将波特率更改为 57600。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:141
#: 50b62e7bd0aa4ea383e8a53645ac013b
msgid ""
"Once again start Mission Planner and go to the Configure/Tuning tab and make"
" sure you UNCHECK the box \"Reset on USB connect\""
msgstr "再次启动 Mission Planner，进入配置/调参选项卡，确保取消勾选「USB 连接时重置」复选框。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:147
#: eb4c97fb6cfb44889035e18b5935d93e
msgid ""
"Your Bluetooth device should now be ready and you can connect to the proper "
"port at the proper baud rate of 57600 (red LED steady on and not flashing)"
msgstr "您的蓝牙设备现在应已准备好，可以在正确的端口以 57600 波特率连接（红色 LED 常亮，不再闪烁）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:152
#: b3dc68083ffb4b97aed2fc31300b0bab
msgid "Connecting From your Android ground station"
msgstr "从 Android 地面站连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:154
#: c8895147c23e471fb9b05764cddfabd8
msgid ""
"These instructions will show you how to connect to your vehicle from "
"AndroPilot or DroidPlanner 2 running on  NExus 7 tablet using the Bluetooth "
"module."
msgstr ""
"以下说明将向您展示如何使用蓝牙模块，通过运行在 Nexus 7 平板上的 AndroPilot 或 DroidPlanner 2 连接到您的飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:158
#: 02dbc7c0377c4f08b1e859217fc7ae4d
msgid ""
"Open the Android device's settings application and turn Bluetooth "
"connectivity ON (usually by sliding a slider to the right).  In the same "
"settings screen click on \"Bluetooth\" which should cause a list of "
"AVAILABLE DEVICES to appear"
msgstr "打开 Android 设备的设置应用并开启蓝牙连接（通常通过向右滑动滑块）。在同一设置页面中点击「蓝牙」，这将显示可用设备列表。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:163
#: cab544939be6435391d519686cc038c8
msgid ""
"Power the vehicle and the \"HC-06\" device should appear.  Click on it and "
"enter \"1234\" or \"0000\" as the PIN to pair with the device, then select "
"OK."
msgstr "为飞行器上电，「HC-06」设备应该会出现。点击它，输入「1234」或「0000」作为 PIN 与设备配对，然后选择确定。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:167
#: 238ccc384c634459bf899d9f2d2d6e77
msgid "The device will appear under \"PAIRED DEVICES\""
msgstr "设备将出现在「已配对设备」下。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:169
#: 10012bfd2b7042269062b3a0fa3fbdd0
msgid "If using DroidPlanner:"
msgstr "如果使用 DroidPlanner："

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:171
#: ff25fe29b004474bb97d67e8c5c9f6dc
msgid ""
"open the Droid Planner settings, and select Telemetry Connection Type, "
"Bluetooth."
msgstr "打开 DroidPlanner 设置，选择数传连接类型为蓝牙。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:173
#: 1a3508f54dbe4d34bedce98201cde11c
msgid ""
"In the main DroidPlanner interface, select Connect, and select the paired "
"Bluetooth device."
msgstr "在 DroidPlanner 主界面中，选择连接，然后选择已配对的蓝牙设备。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:176
#: 4094f1d08bd54baf92532257e9146585
msgid "If using AndroPilot:"
msgstr "如果使用 AndroPilot："

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:178
#: 4e461c8074934d1ba7ef0b480ec3501a
msgid "a \"bluetooth\" button should appear on the screen, click it"
msgstr "屏幕上应会出现「蓝牙」按钮，点击它。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:180
#: 179fe3507cd949ac9323db8c116b7923
msgid ""
"When live data appears on the screen, you’re ready to start mission "
"planning."
msgstr "当屏幕上出现实时数据时，您就可以开始任务规划了。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:184
#: 76ca097386014844aadd5ba98c83e46c
msgid "How to Change Baud Rate, Device Name and Device PIN"
msgstr "如何更改波特率、设备名称和设备 PIN"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:186
#: b56da683b9f2479194807de9066b9250
msgid ""
"You will need a FTDI to USB cable to change any of the configurations of the"
" device (not supplied) It is not necessary to change anything in order for "
"your BT device to function properly it will function quite well as supplied."
" This is for reference and your convenience only!"
msgstr ""
"您需要一根 FTDI 转 USB "
"电缆来更改设备的任何配置（未随附）。更改任何内容对于蓝牙设备正常运行并非必要，默认配置即可正常工作。这仅供参考和方便使用！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:191
#: 12b36bac39514b3bbfb8428d072a2416
msgid ""
"To change the above you need a \"Terminal\" emulator program. You can not "
"use \"Putty\" (a popular serial port tool)  because it will not accept "
"\"line\" commands. The Bluetooth Modules read the input at a rate of once "
"per second therefore you must use an emulator that will allow you to input "
"an entire line before hitting \"send\". You can use the Arduino IDE to send "
"commands to the com port if you are familiar with that. I use \"Advanced "
"Serial Port Terminal\" but any terminal emulator that allows you to type in "
"a line of text before hitting send will work just a good."
msgstr ""
"要进行上述更改，您需要一个「终端」仿真器程序。不能使用「Putty」（一款流行的串口工具），因为它不接受「行」命令。蓝牙模块以每秒一次的速率读取输入，因此您必须使用允许您输入完整行再点击「发送」的仿真器。如果您熟悉"
" Arduino IDE，也可以用它向 COM 端口发送命令。我使用「Advanced Serial Port "
"Terminal」，但任何允许您在点击发送前输入一行文本的终端仿真器都同样适用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:201
#: ded25b14f5744cb987f216cc932dd85c
msgid "Change the baud rate"
msgstr "更改波特率"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:203
#: 239f34cff9ff44fc9fccd086877057d4
msgid ""
"The index  after the command AT+BAUD corresponds to the following baud rate:"
msgstr "AT+BAUD 命令后的索引对应以下波特率："

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:206
#: 191d6398aaac4ba09fbba2b42ac84ea9
msgid "1----1200bps"
msgstr "1----1200bps"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:208
#: b35fe5274a38485f88b3b9112ab14c85
msgid "2----2400bps"
msgstr "2----2400bps"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:210
#: f4af0ccec8484373ab265262053b36a7
msgid "3----4800bps"
msgstr "3----4800bps"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:212
#: 08199be523de4b839d22580a6714390d
msgid "4----9600bps"
msgstr "4----9600bps"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:214
#: 909c87fdc46c484a834e1112765ede8f
msgid "5----19200bps"
msgstr "5----19200bps"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:216
#: 7ae2426200ca4dca87495bfd2515c472
msgid "6----38400bps"
msgstr "6----38400bps"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:218
#: 62b3c48191a84367b07e689df4d337e8
msgid "7----57600bps"
msgstr "7----57600bps"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:220
#: 188e6b5574234d89bd3b331b1e864b89
msgid "8----115200bps"
msgstr "8----115200bps"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:222
#: ec9e2f7e89e64de78c230c5899a9ebbd
msgid ""
"There are additional baud rates. Warning! do not set these baud rates unless"
" you have a special fast UART chip. If you don't know do not use these rates"
" they are beyond the standard PC UART speed and once set you will loose "
"communication with the device and the only way to contact the device after "
"that will be with a high speed UART.  (these are for reference only)"
msgstr ""
"还有其他波特率可用。警告！除非您有特殊的高速 UART 芯片，否则请勿设置这些波特率。如果您不了解，请勿使用这些速率，它们超出了标准 PC UART "
"速度，一旦设置，您将失去与设备的通信，唯一能恢复联系的方法是使用高速 UART。（以下仅供参考）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:229
#: 146ae14832104f32b45c19c88c6b4e88
msgid "9----230400bps"
msgstr "9----230400bps"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:231
#: 812bbc41c182477197d4ce019fe7d8dd
msgid "A----460800bps"
msgstr "A----460800bps"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:233
#: fdd2bd67f4d24c64a79ad78abda50c68
msgid "B----921600bps"
msgstr "B----921600bps"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:235
#: 6e6133dc999845d2a2d31aa2c2f04ec4
msgid "C----1382400bps"
msgstr "C----1382400bps"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:237
#: bc3919fb02834873b888ae886807e617
msgid ""
"The change of Baud rate takes effect immediately after the command is sent. "
"So if you want to keep configuring the Bluetooth module, you need to set the"
" Baud rate of your terminal program to the new Baud rate the Bluetooth is "
